@startuml logic-chat-crud
title UniChat — Generic CRUD engine over the five aggregates (reference logic from master)

database "JSON store: <app_data>/unichat_db\n(nosql_orm JsonProvider)" as DB
participant "crud.macro.rs /\ncrud_command::crud_execute" as GEN
participant "typed commands\n(chat_*_command.rs)" as TYP
participant "CrudService" as SVC

note over GEN
  Aggregates (entities/):
  * ChatMessage      { id, channel_id, platform, username, text, badges, emotes, timestamp, ... }
  * ChatChannel      { id, platform, channel_id, channel_name, is_active, ... }
  * ChatAccount      { id, platform, user_id, username, access_token, refresh_token, expires_at, auth_status }
  * CustomEmote      { id, platform, code, url, ... }
  * DashboardPreferences { id, layout widgets, density, filters }
end note

== Typed surface (one set per aggregate) ==
TYP : create_<agg>(input)            -> insert via repo, return entity
TYP : get_<agg>(id)                  -> find by id or 404-style error
TYP : get_<agg>s(filter?, limit?, offset?) -> list with optional predicate
TYP : get_chat_accounts_by_platform(platform)
TYP : get_chat_account_by_platform_and_user(platform, user_id)
TYP : get_chat_channel_by_platform_and_id(platform, channel_id)
TYP : update_<agg>(id, input)        -> full replace + validate
TYP : patch_<agg>(id, json patch)    -> partial merge
TYP : delete_<agg>(id)               -> remove
TYP : delete_chat_messages_by_channel(channel_id) -> bulk delete, returns count
TYP : get_or_create_dashboard_preferences() -> singleton semantics

== Dynamic surface ==
GEN : crud_execute({ entity, operation, payload })
GEN -> SVC: dispatch to same CrudService\n(registered relations:\nChatMessage->Channel, Channel->Account, ...)
SVC -> DB: JSON read/modify/write per table

All responses wrapped in Response<T> envelope:
{ status, code, message, data }

Validation: nosql_orm #[Validate] on entities runs before save.

note over TYP: dioxus-migration status: the full typed surface is mirrored\n1:1 in webapp/src/application/handlers/handlers.rs (incl. crud_execute),\nbut every body returns Default/empty — no repository, no validation,\nno persistence. LocalStorage exists but is in-memory and unwired.
@enduml
